sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Orchestrator
    participant OrderService
    participant InventoryService
    participant PaymentService

    Client->>Orchestrator: Place order
    Orchestrator->>OrderService: Create pending order
    OrderService-->>Orchestrator: Order created
    Orchestrator->>InventoryService: Reserve stock
    InventoryService-->>Orchestrator: Reserved
    Orchestrator->>PaymentService: Charge card (pivot)
    PaymentService-->>Orchestrator: Charged
    Orchestrator->>OrderService: Mark approved
    Orchestrator-->>Client: Order complete

    Note over Orchestrator: On failure after a completed step,<br/>compensate in reverse order
